                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_NTktwT": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "css_class": "",
                        "text": "<p>N.O. Beetz is engineered around the two foundational pillars of athletic performance: oxygen delivery and cellular energy. By supporting nitric oxide production and supplying direct ATP fuel, this dual-action formula helps athletes train harder, perform longer, and recover more efficiently.</p><p>Whether you're pushing endurance limits, chasing explosive power, or optimizing daily training output, N.O. Beetz delivers a strategic advantage without relying on stimulants.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Superior Endurance & Efficiency:</strong> Our fermented beet powder generates nitric oxide gas immediately upon dissolving in water, promoting vasodilation. This widening of your blood vessels allows for more efficient oxygen and nutrient delivery to working muscles, helping you sustain your effort and reduce perceived exertion during long events.</li><li><strong>Faster Warm-Ups:</strong> By increasing blood flow within minutes, N.O. Beetz acts as a \"pre-warm-up,\" helping to \"open up\" your vascular system. Your muscles get the oxygen they need sooner, preparing your body for optimal performance from the first minute.</li><li><strong>Peak Power & Sprint Force:</strong> Patented PEAK ATP® provides a direct, usable source of cellular energy. This is crucial for funding explosive movements, supporting peak force during lifts, and powering all-out sprints.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Muscle Pump & Vascularity:</strong> Your brain is a high-performance engine that thrives on oxygen. Improved circulation helps support cognitive function, keeping you sharp and focused, even when your body is under intense physical stress.</li><li><strong>Sharpened Mental Focus:</strong> The nitric oxide boost delivers that satisfying muscle pump strength athletes seek. This is a clear sign of increased blood flow and nutrient shutNO2Uing, creating the ideal environment for performance and muscle cell hydration.</li><li><strong>Accelerated Recovery:</strong> Efficient blood flow doesn’t stop when your workout does. It helps to quickly clear metabolic byproducts from muscle tissue, supporting a faster recovery process so you can get back to training sooner.</li><li><strong>Optimized Cellular Hydration:</strong>  With N.O. Beetz, you get the added benefit of balanced electrolytes, crucial for maintaining optimal cellular hydration. This helps prevent cramping and supports sustained performance, especially during long, intense sessions.</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
